{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Part of #148. Depends on the views fetch.\n\n- Columns are the view's visible fields in the view's order (`Title`, `Assignees`, `Status`, custom fields, …); fields vig cannot render (e.g. `Linked pull requests`) are skipped.\n- `sortByFields` is the initial sort; `h` / `l` / `s` still change the sort column locally.\n- `groupByFields` renders group header rows (one per field value, in the field's option order, `No <field>` last).\n- The current `t` table mode is folded into this: a Table view renders as a table, and `t` on a Board view still gives a temporary table of the same items.","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T03:05:59Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":150,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: Table layout driven by the saved view"}
